OL,5,G2305 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,6,     FThe women are searched before
OL,7,     Ftheir first day at the factory and
OL,8,     FErica warns them not toabuse this
OL,9,     Fprivilege. Paul speaks up for Gail
OL,10,     Fat her committal hearing, but to
OL,11,     Flittle effect.
OL,12,G0005 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,13,     FGail gets a frosty reception in
OL,14,     Fthe rec room, causing Judy to
OL,15,     Fstand up for her. Vera complains
OL,16,     Fto Erica about the working
OL,17,     Fconditions at the factory - for
OL,18,     Fthe officers, not the inmates.
