OL,5,G0110 Dogs Behaving (Very) Badly
OL,6,     FIn Wales, Graeme Hall meets
OL,7,     FLabradoodle Luigi who, despite
OL,8,     Fgiving a stellar stand-up routine
OL,9,     Fon his hind legs, also suffers
OL,10,     Ffrom crippling performance
OL,11,     Fanxiety. Can Graeme help him?
OL,12,G0210 Dogs Behaving (Very) Badly
